        - !<reference> 18e04c1e-354e-4b55-9266-e1c36f5fe788
      exampleInfo: !<string[]>
        - "Hero Button: press softly — the cap follows your finger and the bar shows the press depth. One click per press."
        - "Keypad: twelve keys share the same fingertips. Type a code, C clears, OK sends."
        - "Shapes & Toggle: round, square and pill buttons, and a toggle that latches the light on."
        - "Pressure: push deeper for a brighter lamp — the press value is continuous."
        - "Any Finger: pinch the ball and press the button with it. Anything with a transform can be a finger."
        - "UIKit look: the same soft press, styled like UIKit buttons — no UIKit components, just the package's own meshes and materials."
