  Text: "Agnostic 3D Button: one soft-press button for any finger. Push the buttons gently with your index finger, from the top — the cap follows your finger and clicks once per press. Step through the examples with the carousel: a hero button, a keypad, shapes and a toggle, a pressure lamp, and a ball that presses a button."
